{"id": "swebq0220", "pool": "swebq", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Elvis Presley is famous for being a pop music icon. He was known as the \"King of Rock and Roll\" because he helped bring rock and roll to mainstream audiences in the 1950s. His unique style, energetic performance s, and charismatic presence made him incredibly popular. He had many hit songs like \"H appy Birthday,\" \"Jailhouse Rock,\" and \"Heartbreak Hotel,\" and he influenced countless artists after him. Plus, his image—long hair, flashy outfits, and a larger-than- life persona— became part of pop culture history.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 29, "carrier_ended": null}
